<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese warships and coast guard vessels are again shadowing a U.S. warship near a disputed shoal while also operating around the Pratas Islands and Scarborough Shoal, prompting the Philippines to summon China’s ambassador over threatening remarks. Vice Admiral Rommel Supangan has taken command of the Philippine Coast Guard and led a rescue of four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island, Surigao del Sur. Taiwan’s coast guard and maritime forces repelled sixteen mainland Chinese ships near the Pratas Islands. The United States and the Philippines conducted their sixteenth bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea. There were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOWWNuRTZYWVRmRmE5dGJaXzFiWXZGTnRfdUY0eWd6a0xoV2owbTdsVUk1enVrMmRYVlJTN1M4Und4YUs1VW11Y0NJa3BjWk4ySmxpd0NJVGNjcktlVHVYRFZMWklBYnY1b2hpcWMyVnBQSS1GcEN4bEJ4blFlUEwxNm9nUXFmVmRNNDJkV3BTbGVtN09leEtjVXRxOElTRk4wbHRTN00yZmJ0dlNIbGx4aTZGUUttb1N4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philippine Canadian Inquirer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxONEM0cXhZUFhMQkJNZzloSHk5Snh2VlJZdU5YczFEV05pbWhfcWhORjFJU1NXRTBsUUNEb2lxMDJvOWFIRFhpcVB4UEo0RFU2QndnZDAwRE5yOXJneWhDLUpMbGdIYzZqOEk4RDAtYnhySXpPTWZHUGtZS1N1ZkZTU0NHcTBqZmMzQkhVWlVRUDRrb3RyQldwdjlyVUo1NGJs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ships &amp;amp; Ports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9DVlFvSElyMTI2TVl2d19mSFRYdHFhS1NFeVAwcnlVSTg5M0xxenRaM1YweVhGVnB0dmZkbm11QUJzVk9oeVFocmhEVndNa0JLekxB?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل ال